<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective April 24.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.28     24.28	  4.16-9.39  4.16-9.39</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.28     24.28	  3.97-8.96  3.97-8.96</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     27.60     26.32	 11.43	12.07</p>
<p> White sugar	  27.60     26.32	  6.91	 7.55</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.28	0.26	  0.37	 0.39</p>
</text>
